    "testimonials_AiwyPk": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "testimonial_bpMX9x": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>I no longer need to wear makeup when I leave my house. I haven’t felt this good about myself in years!<\/p>",
            "author": "ALLISON",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_AAUQa4": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>My skin is tighter, firmer and more hydrated. My skin looks more even and dark spots are going away!<\/p>",
            "author": "Kim Hopkins",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_UpT9UJ": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>For me, it’s nothing short of a miracle. People comment on my skin all the time. I don’t wear foundation anymore, and I’m told I’ve never looked better, despite constant travel, stress and age!<\/p>",
            "author": "KITA",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_X49Xpe": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>UltraLuxe completely changed the quality of my skin. I can feel the products working every time I use it. My skin has never been happier and it’s all because of UltraLuxe.<\/p>",
            "author": "LAURA",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_rqwt9z": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>Since starting to use UltraLuxe products, I have less irritation, my skin feels so much better, and I think it looks a lot better. I love that it’s effective and all-natural, and smells and feels good when applied.<\/p>",
            "author": "BRANDON",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_9bNteh": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>UltraLuxe products are great! I love that they’re not greasy and absorb completely into the skin! I’m able to easily put my makeup on once it dries and I don’t look greasy.<\/p>",
            "author": "KIM RIFE",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        }
      },
