        "title": "WHY CHOOSE US?",
        "text": "<p>Family-owned since 1998, Ultraluxe is all about clean ingredients with professional results. Our line is Made in USA, Vegan and Cruelty-Free. We carefully craft each product in our Los Angeles-based facility with the finest ingredients like cold-pressed essential oils and cutting-edge ingredients like our exclusive MicroVenom technology. Our products are concentrated without feeling heavy on your skin and are always paraben, sulfate, artificial dye and artificial fragrance-free.<\/p>",
